# 📡 API Notifications — Documentation Frontend

> **Base URL HTTP :** `http://localhost:8000/api/notifications/`  
> **WebSocket :** `ws://localhost:8000/ws/notifications/?token=<access_token>`  
> **Auth :** requis sur tous les endpoints

